family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027 data-pasted\u003d\"true\"\u003eJoin a growing private aviation management company where your work directly supports the technology behind safe, reliable, and exceptional flight operations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003ePlaneSense, Inc. is seeking a talented Senior-level Full Stack Software Engineer to design, develop, and support mission-critical applications used across flight operations, maintenance, customer support, crew management, and business operations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eAs part of a small, collaborative engineering team, you will work across the entire technology stack, contributing to web, mobile, API, cloud, and database solutions. The ideal candidate is passionate about software development, enjoys solving complex business problems, and thrives in an environment where innovation, ownership, and teamwork are highly valued.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eJob Location: Portsmouth, NH or Boston, MA metro area commutable distance preferred; U.S. remote may be considered for exceptionally qualified candidates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;\"\u003eKey Responsibilities\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Stack Application Development\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cul style\u003d\"margin-bottom:0in;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 0in;\"\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eDesign, develop, and maintain enterprise web applications using Microsoft .NET and C#.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eBuild modern, responsive user interfaces using Blazor.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eDevelop and maintain cross-platform mobile applications using .NET MAUI.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eDevelop and maintain RESTful APIs, web services, and backend integrations.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eDesign and implement scalable, secure, and maintainable software architectures.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eDesign, develop, and optimize stored procedures, functions, views using Microsoft SQL Server.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eBuild and support services utilizing Azure App Services, Azure Functions, Azure SQL Database, Service Bus, Storage Services.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eParticipate in CI/CD implementation and deployment automation\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003ePublish and manage application releases through the Apple App Store and Google Play Store.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eParticipate in all phases of the software development lifecycle, including requirements gathering, design, implementation, testing, deployment, and support.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:.25in;text-indent:0in;line-height:105%;font-size:14px;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCollaboration and Continuous Improvement\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cul style\u003d\"margin-bottom:0in;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 0in;\"\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eWork closely with business stakeholders, product owners, and technical team members to deliver high-quality, responsive, resilient and secure software solutions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eParticipate in architecture discussions, code reviews, sprint planning, and technical design sessions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eSupport production systems and troubleshoot issues when necessary.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eContribute to engineering standards, best practices, and ongoing modernization initiatives.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;\"\u003eRequired Qualifications\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cul style\u003d\"margin-bottom:0in;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 0in;\"\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eBachelor\u0026#39;s degree or higher in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field, or equivalent professional experience.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e5+ years of professional software development experience.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eStrong demonstrable experience with Microsoft .NET, C#, ASP.NET, REST APIs / Web Services, and Microsoft SQL Server.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience developing web applications using Blazor.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience developing mobile applications using .NET MAUI, Xamarin, or similar mobile frameworks.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience developing enterprise systems using Kafka or similar message queueing technologies.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eHands-on experience deploying and supporting applications in Microsoft Azure.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience publishing and maintaining applications in the Apple App Store and Google Play Store.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eUnderstanding of software architecture, design patterns, and secure coding practices.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience with Git-based source control systems and modern DevOps practices.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience with AI-assisted or agentic AI software development .\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;\"\u003ePreferred Qualifications\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003e\u003cul style\u003d\"margin-bottom:0in;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 0in;\"\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience within aviation, aerospace, transportation, logistics, or other operationally critical and cyber security critical industries.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience integrating with third-party APIs and enterprise systems.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience with event-driven architectures and messaging platforms.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eFamiliarity with Azure DevOps or GitHub Actions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eKnowledge of authentication and security frameworks such as OAuth, OpenID Connect, Entra ID, or Okta.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience working in Agile/Scrum development environments.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eExperience working with Atlassian products.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0in;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif;\u0027\u003eUnderstanding of mobile device capabilities, offline synchronization, push notifications, biometrics, and platform-specific features.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style\u003d\u0027margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margi